node_modules/

# vendor/ IS committed. This project has no bundler, so the vendored three build is not a
# build artifact — it is what the site serves. GitHub Pages has no npm step, so a gitignored
# vendor/ means a deployed page that 404s its entire runtime.
# Refresh it with `npm run vendor` after bumping three in package.json.

